@startuml
actor Tutor
participant API
participant GetRevenueStatisticsHandler as Handler
database SQLServer as DB

Tutor -> API: GET /api/tutors/me/statistics/revenue
API -> Handler: Query(tutor account ID, currency, startDate, endDate)
Handler -> Handler: Resolve UTC period boundaries
Handler -> DB: Sum owned payments by currency and period
DB --> Handler: Revenue totals
Handler --> API: RevenueStatisticsResponse
API --> Tutor: 200 OK
@enduml
